    - target: {fileID: 3686973092905522621, guid: 3b78f404deb68354e9b08eaf5d093c61,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: title
      value: Krajsy Islans
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3686973092905522621, guid: 3b78f404deb68354e9b08eaf5d093c61,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: description
      value: 'When trying to generate random islands on a shader, a VRChat player
        called Krajsyboys found that different people would see different islands.
        It turned out that this depended on the GPU.


        The reasin is that
        the randomization function used a bunch of sin functions. For complex funcitons,
        computers usually approximate the values. And this approximation is different,
        depending on the hardware.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
