--- !u!114 &835007816
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 835007814}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9541d86e2fd84c1d9990edf0852d74ab, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>Physical light effect terms:</b>

    Metallic: A material, where light
    either gets reflected or absorbed

    Dielectric: Non-metallic, material where
    the light can also penetrate into it

    Microfacet: Very small surface detail.
    Usually statistically evaluated instead of modelled

    Roughness: Term that
    describes the shape of the Microfacets, usually 0...1

    Smoothness: 1 - Roughness

    Fresnel:
    Effect, where light gets reflected at grazing angles

    Microfacet masking:
    The microfacets can prevent the light being reflected into the camera

    Ambient
    occlusion: Less of the ambient light reaches small cracks

    ARM: Ambient Occlusion,
    Roughness, Metallic'
