    - target: {fileID: 4742801142062538468, guid: 3b78f404deb68354e9b08eaf5d093c61,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: Just sampling the pixels of textures results in noise, especially when
        scaling it down. Incorporating surrounding pixels makes it better. These
        can be precalculated and stored. Therefore, blurry, low resolution versions
        of the textures are used to make it smoother.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
