    - target: {fileID: 3686973092905522621, guid: 3b78f404deb68354e9b08eaf5d093c61,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: title
      value: Using different inputs like time
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3686973092905522621, guid: 3b78f404deb68354e9b08eaf5d093c61,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: description
      value: 'Unity provides different values that can be used in shaders, such as
        the current time.


        It is implemented like this:

        _Time.x
        = t / 20

        _Time.y = t

        _Time.z = t * 2

        _Time.w =
        t * 3'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
