      propertyPath: title
      value: Cutout with discard
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1055789876787810633, guid: 7ffcca573e1296d47a9191342db0701b,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: description
      value: 'Instead of setting the transparency between 0 and 1, discard creating
        a binary cutout effect.


        Since the values don''t need to be blended
        and modern GPUs have some ability to benefit from early function exits, clipping
        is more performant than transparency.


        However, there is still some
        performance cost caused by overdraw.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
