    - target: {fileID: 1055789876787810633, guid: 7ffcca573e1296d47a9191342db0701b,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: description
      value: 'Instead of using using the red, geen blue color channels, it is often
        useful to use HSV instead.

        Hue is the type of color, like red, blue,
        green...

        Saturation blends the color towards white/black.

        Value
        determines the brightness of the color and changes the saturation blending
        point between white and black.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
