    - target: {fileID: 1055789876787810633, guid: 7ffcca573e1296d47a9191342db0701b,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: description
      value: 'UV maps are used to display 2D textures on a 3D model. When painting
        a 3D model, the artists have therefore define where different faces are on
        the 2D picture plane.


        This shader shows how the texture coordinates
        of the SF-1 from SaccFlight are mapped.

'
