    - target: {fileID: 1055789876787810633, guid: 7ffcca573e1296d47a9191342db0701b,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: description
      value: 'In many cases, the relevant question for the implementation is not
        about defining the color for each part of the model individually but instead
        to define the type of material. However, this type should still have variations
        that can be stored in a texture.


        Triplanar mapping takes this 2D
        texture and stamps it onto the mesh from 3 sides.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
