    - target: {fileID: 3686973092905522621, guid: 3b78f404deb68354e9b08eaf5d093c61,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: description
      value: 'A Voronoi starts with a grid system and then generates a random point
        inside each cell. By doing this for the surrounding cells allows calculating
        the 3 Voronoi values:

        - Distance to the closest center

        -
        Unique cell id

        - Distance to the closest border'
