    - target: {fileID: 1055789876787810633, guid: 7ffcca573e1296d47a9191342db0701b,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: title
      value: Depth buffer<br>LessEqual write
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1055789876787810633, guid: 7ffcca573e1296d47a9191342db0701b,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: description
      value: 'When it is know that the depth buffer only changes in one direction,
        the GPU can still do some optimization. Note that first promising to only
        change it in one direction and then doing the other cuases graphical glitches.


        With
        reverse Z, where 1 is at the near clip, LessEqual means the depth vaue should
        be furter away than the automatic calculation.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
