      propertyPath: title
      value: Cross product
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1055789876787810633, guid: 7ffcca573e1296d47a9191342db0701b,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: description
      value: "The cross product returns the normal to the plane formed by the other
        2 vectors.\n\nThe mathematical definition is consistent:\ncross(+X, +Y) =
        +Z\n\nHowever, the interpretation depends on the environemnt. Unity uses
        a left handed coordinate system, so the direction is returned as shown.\n\nThe
        distance can be calculated by:\n   length(a) * length(b)\n   * sin(angle
        between a&b)"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
