      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1055789876787810633, guid: 7ffcca573e1296d47a9191342db0701b,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: description
      value: 'Brigness is about how much light a color emmits. This can be measured.
        When scaling the output linearly, the output above is the result.


        Unity
        allows outputting colors in different color spaces. To calculate lights correctly,
        the linear color space is best since light values can easily be summed together
        to get a physically accurate result.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
