      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1055789876787810633, guid: 7ffcca573e1296d47a9191342db0701b,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: description
      value: 'To the human eye, Yellow and green look brighter than red or full blue.
        This causes certain problems. When for example generating a random HSV hue
        on a dark background, yellow will be clearly visible while blue will be hard
        to read.


        Oklab tries to fix this by using colors with the same
        perceived brightness.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
