    - target: {fileID: 1055789876787810633, guid: 7ffcca573e1296d47a9191342db0701b,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: description
      value: 'A vector describes an offset between different independent dimensions.


        For
        example, -3 on its own describes a differnece that is negative.


        3D
        space is defined by 3 independent dimensions. No matter how long you move
        along the X axis, your Y position won''t change.


        The Vector (1,
        3, -4) means:

        Offset of 1 in the +X direction

        Offset of
        3 in the +Y direction

        Offset of 4 in the -Z direction'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
